{"page":202,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:94","surah":9,"ayah":94,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْتَذِرُونَ إِلَيْكُمْ إِذَا رَجَعْتُمْ إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ قُل لَّا تَعْتَذِرُوا۟ لَن نُّؤْمِنَ لَكُمْ قَدْ نَبَّأَنَا ٱللَّهُ مِنْ أَخْبَارِكُمْ ۚ وَسَيَرَى ٱللَّهُ عَمَلَكُمْ وَرَسُولُهُۥ ثُمَّ تُرَدُّونَ إِلَىٰ عَـٰلِمِ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ فَيُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you return from the expedition they will carry on coming to you [believers] with excuses. Say, ‘Do not make excuses. We do not believe you: God has told us about you. God and His Messenger will watch your actions now, and in the end you will be returned to the One who knows the seen and the unseen. He will confront you with what you have done.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْتَذِرُونَ","en_gloss":"They will make excuses","transliteration":"yaʿtadhirūna","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَجَعْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you (have) returned","transliteration":"rajaʿtum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"make excuse","transliteration":"taʿtadhirū","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نُّؤْمِنَ","en_gloss":"we will believe","transliteration":"nu'mina","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَبَّأَنَا","en_gloss":"Allah (has) informed us","transliteration":"nabba-anā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) informed us","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَخْبَارِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your news","transliteration":"akhbārikum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَسَيَرَى","en_gloss":"and Allah will see","transliteration":"wasayarā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah will see","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَمَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"ʿamalakum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūluhu","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تُرَدُّونَ","en_gloss":"you will be brought back","transliteration":"turaddūna","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":23,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":24,"ar":"عَـٰلِمِ","en_gloss":"(the) Knower","transliteration":"ʿālimi","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the unseen","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","en_gloss":"and the seen","transliteration":"wal-shahādati","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":27,"ar":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","en_gloss":"then He will inform you","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":28,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":29,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":30,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"9:94"},{"pos":31,"ar":"٩٤","en_gloss":"(94)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:94"}]},{"verse_key":"9:95","surah":9,"ayah":95,"ar_uthmani":"سَيَحْلِفُونَ بِٱللَّهِ لَكُمْ إِذَا ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ إِلَيْهِمْ لِتُعْرِضُوا۟ عَنْهُمْ ۖ فَأَعْرِضُوا۟ عَنْهُمْ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ رِجْسٌ ۖ وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ جَزَآءًۢ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you return to them, they will swear to you by God in order to make you leave them alone- so leave them alone: they are loathsome, and Hell will be their home as a reward for their actions-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَيَحْلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"They will swear","transliteration":"sayaḥlifūna","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"by Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you returned","transliteration":"inqalabtum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِتُعْرِضُوا۟","en_gloss":"that you may turn away","transliteration":"lituʿ'riḍū","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَأَعْرِضُوا۟","en_gloss":"So turn away","transliteration":"fa-aʿriḍū","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رِجْسٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) impure","transliteration":"rij'sun","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their abode","transliteration":"wamawāhum","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ","en_gloss":"(is) Hell","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جَزَآءًۢ","en_gloss":"a recompense","transliteration":"jazāan","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","verse_key":"9:95"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٩٥","en_gloss":"(95)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:95"}]},{"verse_key":"9:96","surah":9,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"يَحْلِفُونَ لَكُمْ لِتَرْضَوْا۟ عَنْهُمْ ۖ فَإِن تَرْضَوْا۟ عَنْهُمْ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَرْضَىٰ عَنِ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they will swear to you in order to make you accept them, but even if you do accept them, God will not accept people who rebel against Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَحْلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"They swear","transliteration":"yaḥlifūna","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِتَرْضَوْا۟","en_gloss":"that you may be pleased","transliteration":"litarḍaw","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَرْضَوْا۟","en_gloss":"you are pleased","transliteration":"tarḍaw","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(is) not pleased","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَرْضَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) not pleased","transliteration":"yarḍā","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_gloss":"(who are) defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","verse_key":"9:96"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٩٦","en_gloss":"(96)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:96"}]},{"verse_key":"9:97","surah":9,"ayah":97,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابُ أَشَدُّ كُفْرًا وَنِفَاقًا وَأَجْدَرُ أَلَّا يَعْلَمُوا۟ حُدُودَ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The desert Arabs are the most stubborn of all peoples in their disbelief and hypocrisy. They are the least likely to recognize the limits that God has sent down to His Messenger. God is all knowing and all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْرَابُ","en_gloss":"The bedouins","transliteration":"al-aʿrābu","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"(are) stronger","transliteration":"ashaddu","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُفْرًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) disbelief","transliteration":"kuf'ran","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَنِفَاقًۭا","en_gloss":"and hypocrisy","transliteration":"wanifāqan","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَجْدَرُ","en_gloss":"and more likely","transliteration":"wa-ajdaru","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَعْلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"they know","transliteration":"yaʿlamū","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حُدُودَ","en_gloss":"(the) limits","transliteration":"ḥudūda","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) revealed","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَسُولِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlihi","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":16,"ar":"حَكِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","verse_key":"9:97"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٩٧","en_gloss":"(97)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:97"}]},{"verse_key":"9:98","surah":9,"ayah":98,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلْأَعْرَابِ مَن يَتَّخِذُ مَا يُنفِقُ مَغْرَمًا وَيَتَرَبَّصُ بِكُمُ ٱلدَّوَآئِرَ ۚ عَلَيْهِمْ دَآئِرَةُ ٱلسَّوْءِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of the desert Arabs consider what they give to be an imposition; they are waiting for fortune to turn against you, but fortune will turn against them. God is all hearing and all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","en_gloss":"the bedouins","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَتَّخِذُ","en_gloss":"takes","transliteration":"yattakhidhu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُنفِقُ","en_gloss":"he spends","transliteration":"yunfiqu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَغْرَمًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a loss","transliteration":"maghraman","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَتَرَبَّصُ","en_gloss":"and he awaits","transliteration":"wayatarabbaṣu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِكُمُ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"bikumu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلدَّوَآئِرَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the turns (of misfortune)","transliteration":"l-dawāira","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"Upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دَآئِرَةُ","en_gloss":"(will be) the turn","transliteration":"dāiratu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلسَّوْءِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) the evil","transliteration":"l-sawi","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَمِيعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearer","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"9:98"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٩٨","en_gloss":"(98)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:98"}]},{"verse_key":"9:99","surah":9,"ayah":99,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلْأَعْرَابِ مَن يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ وَيَتَّخِذُ مَا يُنفِقُ قُرُبَـٰتٍ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَصَلَوَٰتِ ٱلرَّسُولِ ۚ أَلَآ إِنَّهَا قُرْبَةٌ لَّهُمْ ۚ سَيُدْخِلُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ فِى رَحْمَتِهِۦٓ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But there are also some desert Arabs who believe in God and the Last Day and consider their contributions as bringing them nearer to God and the prayers of the Messenger: they will indeed bring them nearer and God will admit them to His mercy. God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"But among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","en_gloss":"the bedouins","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"believes","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَتَّخِذُ","en_gloss":"and takes","transliteration":"wayattakhidhu","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُنفِقُ","en_gloss":"he spends","transliteration":"yunfiqu","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قُرُبَـٰتٍ","en_gloss":"(as) means of nearness","transliteration":"qurubātin","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَصَلَوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"and blessings","transliteration":"waṣalawāti","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَآ","en_gloss":"Behold","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنَّهَا","en_gloss":"Indeed, it","transliteration":"innahā","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":18,"ar":"قُرْبَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a means of nearness","transliteration":"qur'batun","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":20,"ar":"سَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah will admit them","transliteration":"sayud'khiluhumu","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will admit them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":23,"ar":"رَحْمَتِهِۦٓ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":24,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":26,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":27,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"9:99"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٩٩","en_gloss":"(99)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:99"}]}]}